    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "NORTHWEST\nAIRLINES\nPon\nDes\nFlight\nSchedule\nEffective\nJune 2,\n1999-\nSept. 7,\n1999\nFor\nNonstop\nand Direct\nFlights\nCall Northwest\nAirlines at\n1-800-225-2525,\npurchase tickets\nonline at\nwww.nwa.com,\nor call your\ntravel agent.\nFORLDWI\nKLM\nOSAKA, JAPAN",
      "Take the Path that Leads to Adventure\nCustom-made Asia Vacations at Package Prices\nNow is a great time to visit Asia, and Northwest Airlines\nWorldVacations™ can take you there at very affordable\nprices. From the gold leaf-covered temples of Bangkok, to\nthe views from China's Great Wall, WorldVacations has a\npackage to Asia for you. WorldVacations offers fantastic\nair and land packages to:\nv Hong Kong\n7 Beijing\n7 Bangkok\nTokyo\nSingapore\n/ Shanghai\nWorld Vacations Packages to Asia Include:\n7 Roundtrip, Coach Class air transportation via nonstop\nand connecting service on Northwest Airlines\n7 Roundtrip transfers between airport and hotel\nHalf-day sightseeing tour\nChoice of hotel accommodations\nHotel taxes and service charges\n7 2,000 WorldVacations WorldPerks® Bonus Miles in\naddition to actual miles flown\n7 And more!\nFor more details, call your professional\ntravel agent or World Vacations at\n1-800-800-1504\nReservation Hours: 7:30 am-8:00 pm (CST) v Monday-Friday\n©1999 Northwest Airlines Inc.\nwww.nwa.com\nNORTHWEST\nAIRLINES\nWorld Vacations™\nWVMS7805"
    ],
